Application icon source installed as @file{tweeta-desktop.png}.

@item tweetapus/
Reference copy of the upstream server source.  Do not modify this directory
from the desktop client project.
@end table

@section Runtime Files

@table @file
@item $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tweeta-desktop/session.json
Session token, username, admin flag, and preserved impersonation admin context.
The client writes this file with user-only permissions where possible.

@item $XDG_CACHE_HOME/tweeta-desktop/
Cache directory used by cache-size display and cache cleanup.
@end table

If @env{XDG_CONFIG_HOME} or @env{XDG_CACHE_HOME} is unset, GLib chooses the
platform default, typically @file{~/.config} and @file{~/.cache} on Linux.

