Generate @file{tweeta-desktop.info} from @file{tweeta-desktop.texi}.

@item make pdf
Generate @file{build/docs/tweeta-desktop.pdf}.

@item make html
Generate single-page HTML at @file{build/docs/tweeta-desktop.html}.

@item make html-split
Generate multi-page HTML rooted at @file{build/docs/html/index.html}.

@item make docs
